<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111845" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλόος</span></b> , ὁ, metaplast.
		acc. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλόα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Al.</u>
					302
				</span></i>
			: 
				contr.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλοῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
					229.10
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1122.17
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				20
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.147
			</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλέω</span>):— rarer form of
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλοιός, παρθένιός μοι ἔπι
			φ.,</span> of a tree, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.706
			</span></i> (Antip.), cf. <u>PCair.Zen.</u> l.c. <span class="entity">(iii B.
				C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> the
			human <i>skin,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
			</span></i> l.c.; also of the <i>slough</i> of serpents, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Th.</u>
				355
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				392
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλους</span></b> , 
				Ion.
			 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλέως,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.98
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>bloom of a plant,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				335
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.683f
			</span></i>.</div>
